msgid "The COSMO model"
msgstr "COSMO 模型"

msgid ""
"The Conductor-like Screening Model (COSMO) (A. Klamt and G. Schüürmann, J. "
"Chem. Soc. Perkin Trans. II 799-805 (1993)) is currently available for HF "
"(``RHF,UHF``) and DFT (``RKS,UKS``) energy calculations and the "
"corresponding gradients."
msgstr ""
"类导体屏蔽模型（COSMO）（A. Klamt 和 G. Schüürmann, J. Chem. Soc. Perkin Trans. II "
"799-805 (1993)）目前可用于 HF（\\ ``RHF,UHF``\\ ）和 DFT（\\ ``RKS,UKS``\\ "
"）能量计算以及相应的梯度。"

msgid "The COSMO model is invoked by the ``COSMO`` card:"
msgstr "COSMO 模型通过 ``COSMO`` 卡片调用："

msgid "where option can be"
msgstr "其中 option 可以是"

msgid ""
"``NPPA`` size of the underlying basis grid. The value must satisfy: "
":math:`value = 10 \\times 3^k \\times 4^l +2` (default = 1082; type "
"integer)."
msgstr ""
"``NPPA`` 基础网格的大小。该值必须满足：\\ :math:`value = 10 \\times 3^k \\times 4^l +2`\\ "
"（默认值 = 1082；类型为整数）。"

msgid ""
"``NSPA`` number of segments for non hydrogen atoms. The value must satisfy: "
":math:`values = 10 \\times 3^k \\times 4^l +2` (default = 92; type integer)."
msgstr ""
"``NSPA`` 非氢原子的分段数。该值必须满足：\\ :math:`values = 10 \\times 3^k \\times 4^l +2`\\"
" （默认值 = 92；类型为整数）。"

msgid ""
"``CAVITY`` the intersection seams of the molecular surface are closed (1) or"
" open (0) (default = 1; type integer)."
msgstr "``CAVITY`` 分子表面的交线是闭合（1）还是开放（0）（默认值 = 1；类型为整数）。"

msgid ""
"``EPSILON`` dielectric permittivity (default = -1.d0, which means "
":math:`\\epsilon=\\infty`; type real)"
msgstr "``EPSILON`` 介电常数（默认值 = -1.d0，表示 :math:`\\epsilon=\\infty`\\ ；类型为实数）"

msgid ""
"``DISEX`` distance criteria for the :math:`\\bf A`-matrix setup. Short range"
" interactions (segment centre distances :math:`<` DISEX :math:`\\times` mean"
" atomic diameter) are calculated using the underlying basis grid. Long range"
" interactions are calculated via the segment centres (default = 10.d0; type "
"float)."
msgstr ""
"``DISEX`` 用于 :math:`\\bf A` 矩阵设置的距离判据。短程相互作用（片段中心距离 :math:`<` DISEX "
":math:`\\times` 平均原子直径）使用底层基础网格计算。长程相互作用通过片段中心计算（默认值 = 10.d0；类型为浮点数）。"

msgid ""
"``ROUTF`` factor used for outer cavity construction. The radii of the outer "
"cavity are defined as: :math:`r^{out}_i=r_i+ROUTF \\times RSOLV` (default = "
"0.85d0; type float)"
msgstr ""
"``ROUTF`` 用于外腔构造的因子。外腔半径定义为：\\ :math:`r^{out}_i=r_i+ROUTF \\times RSOLV`\\ "
"（默认值 = 0.85d0；类型为浮点数）"

msgid ""
"``PHSRAN`` phase offset of coordinate randomization (default = 0.d0; type "
"float)"
msgstr "``PHSRAN`` 坐标随机化的相位偏移（默认值 = 0.d0；类型为浮点数）"

msgid ""
"``AMPRAN`` amplitude factor of coordinate randomization (default = 1.0d-5; "
"type float)"
msgstr "``AMPRAN`` 坐标随机化的振幅因子（默认值 = 1.0d-5；类型为浮点数）"

msgid ""
"``RSOLV`` additional radius for cavity construction (default = -1d0, the "
"optimized H radius is used; type float)."
msgstr "``RSOLV`` 用于腔体构造的附加半径（默认值 = -1d0，使用优化的H原子半径；类型为浮点数）。"

msgid ""
"``MAXNPS`` maximal number of surface segments (default = -1, will be "
"estimated; type integer)."
msgstr "``MAXNPS`` 表面片段的最大数量（默认值 = -1，将由程序估算；类型为整数）。"

msgid ""
"It is recommended to change the default values for problematic cases only."
msgstr "建议仅在遇到问题的情况下更改默认值。"

msgid "where the *radius* has to be given in Å."
msgstr "其中\\ *半径*\\ 必须以Å为单位给出。"

msgid "BASIC THEORY"
msgstr "基本理论"

msgid ""
"COSMO is a continuum solvation model, in which the solvent is represented as"
" a dielectric continuum of permittivity :math:`\\epsilon`. The solute "
"molecule is placed in a cavity inside the continuum. The response of the "
"continuum due to the charge distribution of the solute is described by the "
"generation of a screening charge distribution on the cavity surface. This "
"charge distribution can be calculated by solving the boundary equation of "
"vanishing electrostatic potential on the surface of a conductor. After a "
"discretization of the cavity surface into sufficiently small segments, the "
"vector of the screening charges on the surface segments is"
msgstr ""
"COSMO 是一种连续介质溶剂化模型，其中溶剂被表示为介电常数为 :math:`\\epsilon` "
"的介电连续介质。溶质分子被放置在连续介质内部的一个空腔中。连续介质对溶质电荷分布的响应通过空腔表面生成屏蔽电荷分布来描述。该电荷分布可以通过求解导体表面静电势为零的边界方程来计算。将空腔表面离散化为足够小的片段后，表面片段上的屏蔽电荷向量为"

msgid "{\\bf q^{*}} = -{\\bf A^{-1}} \\Phi"
msgstr ""
"{\\bf q^{*}} = -{\\bf A^{-1}} \\Phi\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"where :math:`\\Phi` is the vector of the potential due to the solute charge "
"distribution on the segments, and :math:`\\bf A` is the interaction matrix "
"of the screening charges on the segments. This solution is exact for an "
"electric conductor. For finite dielectrics the true dielectric screening "
"charges can be approximated very well by scaling the charge density of a "
"conductor with :math:`f(\\epsilon)`."
msgstr ""
"其中 :math:`\\Phi` 是溶质电荷分布在片段上产生的电势向量，\\ :math:`\\bf A` "
"是片段上屏蔽电荷的相互作用矩阵。此解对于电导体是精确的。对于有限介电常数的情况，真实的介电屏蔽电荷可以通过用 :math:`f(\\epsilon)` "
"缩放导体的电荷密度来很好地近似。"

msgid ""
"{\\bf q} = f(\\epsilon) {\\bf q^{*}} ; \\quad f(\\epsilon) = (\\epsilon - "
"1)/(\\epsilon + 0.5)"
msgstr ""
"{\\bf q} = f(\\epsilon) {\\bf q^{*}} ; \\quad f(\\epsilon) = (\\epsilon - 1)/(\\epsilon + 0.5)\n"
"\n"

msgid ""
"In every SCF step the screening charges :math:`\\bf q` have to be generated "
"from the potential :math:`\\Phi`, and then added to the Hamiltonian as "
"external point charges. The total energy of the system is"
msgstr ""
"在每个 SCF 步骤中，必须从电势 :math:`\\Phi` 生成屏蔽电荷 :math:`\\bf q`\\ "
"，然后将其作为外部点电荷添加到哈密顿量中。系统的总能量为"

msgid "E_{tot} = E_{0} + E_{diel}; \\quad E_{diel} = \\frac{1}{2} \\Phi {\\bf q}"
msgstr ""
"E_{tot} = E_{0} + E_{diel}; \\quad E_{diel} = \\frac{1}{2} \\Phi {\\bf q}\n"
"\n"

msgid "``COSMO[,option$_1$=value$_1$, option$_2$=value$_2, \\ldots$]``"
msgstr "``COSMO[,option$_1$=value$_1$, option$_2$=value$_2, \\ldots$]``"

msgid ""
"By default the program uses optimized radii if existent and 1.17\\ "
":math:`\\times`\\ vdW radius else. The optimized radii [Å] are: H=1.30, "
"C=2.00, N=1.83, O=1.72, F=1.72, S=2.16, Cl=2.05, Br=2.16, I=2.32. Own "
"proposals can be given directly subsequent to the cosmo card: ``RAD,symbol, "
"radius``"
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，程序使用优化半径（若存在），否则使用1.17\\ :math:`\\times`\\ vdW半径。优化半径[Å]为：H=1.30, "
"C=2.00, N=1.83, O=1.72, F=1.72, S=2.16, Cl=2.05, Br=2.16, "
"I=2.32。自定义建议可直接在cosmo卡片后给出：\\ ``RAD,symbol, radius``"

msgid ""
"Example: ``cosmo rad,O,1.72 rad,H,1.3   Output file:\\\\`` The COSMO output "
"file will be written after every converged SCF calculation. The segment "
"charges and potentials are corrected by the outlying charge correction. For "
"the total charges and energies corrected and uncorrected values are given. "
"The normal output file contains uncorrected values only. It is recommended "
"to use the corrected values from the output file."
msgstr ""
"示例：\\ ``cosmo rad,O,1.72 rad,H,1.3   Output file:\\\\`` "
"COSMO输出文件将在每次收敛的SCF计算后写入。片段电荷和势通过外部电荷校正进行修正。对于总电荷和能量，给出修正和未修正的值。正常输出文件仅包含未修正的值。建议使用输出文件中修正后的值。"

msgid ""
"Optimizations: It is recommended to use optimizer that operates with "
"gradients exclusively. Line search techniques that use energies tends to "
"fail, because of the energy discontinuities which may occur due to a "
"reorganization of the segments after a geometry step. For the same reasons "
"numerical gradients are not recommended."
msgstr ""
"优化：建议使用仅基于梯度的优化器。使用能量的线搜索技术容易失败，因为几何步进后片段重组可能导致能量不连续。出于同样的原因，不建议使用数值梯度。"

msgid ""
"where :math:`E_{0}` is the bare self-energy of the system and "
":math:`E_{diel}` the dielectric energy. Cavity construction: First a surface"
" of mutually excluding spheres of radius :math:`R_i+rsolv` is constructed, "
"where the :math:`R_i` are the radii of the atoms, defined as element "
"specific radii and :math:`rsolv` is some radius representing a typical "
"maximum curvature of a solvent molecular surface. :math:`rsolv` should not "
"be misinterpreted as a mean solvent radius, nor modified for different "
"solvents. Every atomic sphere is represented by an underlying basis grid of "
"``nppa`` points per full atom. Basis grid points which intersect a sphere of"
" a different atom are neglected. In a second step the remainder of the basis"
" grid points are projected to the surface defined by the radii :math:`R_i`. "
"As a third step of the cavity construction the remaining basis grid points "
"are gathered to segments, which are the areas of constant screening charges "
"in the numerical solution. Finally, the intersection seams between the atoms"
" are filled with additional segments. Now the A-matrix can be set up. The "
"matrix elements will be calculated from the basis grid points of the "
"segments for close and medium segment distances (governed by the ``disex`` "
"value), or using the segment centres for large segment distances. Outlying "
"charge correction: The non vanishing electron density outside the cavity "
"causes an error that can be corrected by the outlying charge correction. "
"This correction uses the potential on the so called outer surface (defined "
"by the radii :math:`R_i+\\mbox{rsolv} \\times \\mbox{routf}`) to estimate a "
"correction term for the screening charges and the energies (A. Klamt and V. "
"Jonas, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.472829>`__ **105**, "
"9972-9981(1996)). The correction will be performed once at the end of a "
"converged SCF calculation. All corrected values can be found in the COSMO "
"output file."
msgstr ""
"其中\\ :math:`E_{0}`\\ 是系统的裸自能，\\ :math:`E_{diel}`\\ 是介电能量。空腔构建：首先构建一个由半径\\ "
":math:`R_i+rsolv`\\ 的互斥球体组成的表面，其中\\ :math:`R_i`\\ 是原子的半径，定义为元素特定半径，而\\ "
":math:`rsolv`\\ 是代表溶剂分子表面典型最大曲率的某个半径。\\ :math:`rsolv`\\ "
"不应被误解为平均溶剂半径，也不应针对不同溶剂进行修改。每个原子球体由每个完整原子的\\ ``nppa``\\ "
"个点的底层基网格表示。与不同原子球体相交的基网格点被忽略。第二步，将剩余的基网格点投影到由半径\\ :math:`R_i`\\ "
"定义的表面上。作为空腔构建的第三步，剩余的基网格点被聚集为片段，这些片段是数值解中恒定屏蔽电荷的区域。最后，原子之间的相交缝隙用额外的片段填充。现在可以建立A矩阵。矩阵元将由片段的基网格点计算，适用于近距离和中距离片段（由\\"
" ``disex``\\ "
"值控制），或对于远距离片段使用片段中心计算。外部电荷校正：空腔外非零的电子密度会导致误差，可通过外部电荷校正来修正。该校正使用所谓外表面（由半径\\ "
":math:`R_i+\\mbox{rsolv} \\times \\mbox{routf}`\\ 定义）上的势来估计屏蔽电荷和能量的校正项（A. "
"Klamt and V. Jonas, `J. Chem. Phys. <https://dx.doi.org/10.1063/1.472829>`__"
" **105**, 9972-9981(1996)）。校正将在收敛的SCF计算结束时执行一次。所有校正值可在COSMO输出文件中找到。"

msgid ""
"Three example inputs can be found in `cosmo_water1.inp "
"<media/examples/cosmo_water1.inp>`__, `cosmo_water2.inp "
"<media/examples/cosmo_water2.inp>`__ and `cosmo_water3.inp "
"<media/examples/cosmo_water3.inp>`__."
msgstr ""
"三个示例输入可在\\ `cosmo_water1.inp <media/examples/cosmo_water1.inp>`__\\ 、\\ "
"`cosmo_water2.inp <media/examples/cosmo_water2.inp>`__\\ 和\\ "
"`cosmo_water3.inp <media/examples/cosmo_water3.inp>`__\\ 中找到。"
